# Dataline uses no customer-specific variables. The optional AUTH_USERNAME/AUTH_PASSWORD
# env vars that Dataline ships are intentionally left unset — the whole subdomain is gated
# by Traefik basic_auth instead, following the same pattern as draw.io and Stirling PDF.
# The OpenAI API key for AI features is entered through Dataline's own settings UI after
# first login. The app hostname is supplied automatically as AF_APP_DOMAIN.
